<report type:"WARNING">
  description : "AIOS-26-015500 - Apple iOS/iPadOS 26 must disable the download of iOS/iPadOS beta updates."
  info        : "Beta operating system updates may contain features that could lead to the compromise of sensitive DOD information or provide a vector for the attack on the DOD network. The current STIG will not normally provide controls to disable these unsecure features.

